# Raw exam question data (full answers/explanations for gated content).
# Generator reads these locally to produce static pages — must NEVER be
# published as-is, or the entire per-question paywall is a no-op (anyone
# can just fetch /exam-data/<exam>.json directly). Keep local, never push.
exam-data/*.json
